{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_class_lexical_declaration", "label": "Class lexical declaration and TDZ", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "class is commonly regarded as non-hoisted. Using one above its declaration throws Cannot access before initialization. Classes are block-scoped and do not create globalThis properties."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_class_inner_immutable_binding", "label": "Const-like inner class binding", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Inside the class body the class name is an immutable binding. Outside it is a reassignable let-like binding. The class body always runs in strict mode."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_extends_evaluated_at_declaration", "label": "extends evaluated at declaration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "extends is an expression evaluated when the class statement runs, not at new. Two classes cannot extend each other; method bodies have no such constraint."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_import_hoisting", "label": "Import hoisting", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Import declarations are hoisted: imported values are available before their line and the imported module's side effects run first. Position in the file does not change evaluation order."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_live_readonly_import_bindings", "label": "Live read-only import bindings", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Imports are read-only views like const. You cannot reassign the imported binding; only the exporting module can change the value, and the change is live."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_circular_esm_import", "label": "Circular ESM import TDZ", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Module evaluation is depth-first. A top-level read of a not-yet-initialised import throws Cannot access before initialization. Defer the read inside an exported function. A cycle is not automatically a bug."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_commonjs_circular_require", "label": "CommonJS circular require", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "require has no dead zone. A circular require returns a partially populated module.exports, typically undefined properties, with no error."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_class_lexical_declaration", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_strict_mode_block_functions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_class_inner_immutable_binding", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_class_lexical_declaration", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_extends_evaluated_at_declaration", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_class_lexical_declaration", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/06-classes-and-circular-imports.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_circular_esm_import", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_06_classes_and_circular_imports_import_hoisting", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "E